            <profile id="ee8a-2ee8-71e9-cb15" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Mounted characters may have heavy armour (+1). One Satrap may be upgraded to Army General (+50). A Satrap has a hand weapon, light armour, composite bow, javelins and shield. May ride a Warhorse (+18), in which case the shield is replaced with a throwing spear. The Warhorse may have half barding (+2).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="c120-d22e-e01d-b01f" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
