              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Lykians have hand weapon, halberd and javelins and may have light armour (+2) and buckler (free) or large shield (+2). Light Infantry. Warband (Rules 5 and 6 only). Both are Warband (rules 5 and 6 only).</characteristic>
