              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each machine has a crew of two armed with hand weapons. They may have light armour (+2). One light ballista may be taken for each Persian unit in the army. Fires as per Roman Scorpio – 36” range, S4, no armour save, D3 wounds.</characteristic>
